00:15:18.140 --> 00:15:19.520
Be prepared!

00:15:28.030 --> 00:15:29.400
I beat him!

00:15:29.400 --> 00:15:31.990
Bro...!

00:15:31.990 --> 00:15:33.910
Well done, Tanarotte!

00:15:33.910 --> 00:15:35.120
Futaba-chan, are you all right?

00:15:35.120 --> 00:15:36.200
Takuto-kun!

00:15:36.510 --> 00:15:38.560
Oh, Takuto-kun...

00:15:38.560 --> 00:15:41.000
You mustn't wrap yourself around Takuto!

00:15:41.000 --> 00:15:44.000
Alright. Time to finish you off.

00:15:44.000 --> 00:15:47.590
Fully automatic mode tit missiles!

00:15:50.080 --> 00:15:50.900
No way!

00:15:50.900 --> 00:15:53.890
The tit missles I knew had infinite ammo!

00:15:53.890 --> 00:15:57.370
Hundreds and thousands of them even fatter than the body.

00:15:57.370 --> 00:15:59.350
Yet why!?

00:16:00.540 --> 00:16:02.750
Heh, you seem to be at your limit.

00:16:03.230 --> 00:16:05.810
Now it's my turn.

00:16:06.230 --> 00:16:06.980
Quiet

00:16:06.980 --> 00:16:07.020
Mad
Quiet

00:16:07.020 --> 00:16:08.150
Mad

00:16:08.860 --> 00:16:10.490
Then I have no choice.

00:16:10.840 --> 00:16:12.820
Look at this, Baltia!!

00:16:14.990 --> 00:16:16.740
Stop it!

00:16:16.740 --> 00:16:19.120
Why... that is...

00:16:19.120 --> 00:16:20.370
What's the matter?

00:16:20.370 --> 00:16:22.060
Not going to attack?

00:16:22.580 --> 00:16:24.670
Of course you can't.

00:16:24.710 --> 00:16:26.170
How can you?

00:16:26.170 --> 00:16:30.300
You could never hurt something like this..

00:16:30.300 --> 00:16:34.980
Then if I do something like this...

00:16:34.980 --> 00:16:38.260
I wonder what you would do.

00:16:39.680 --> 00:16:41.560
Stop! Stop it!

00:16:42.100 --> 00:16:45.060
I'll stop when you accept unconditional surrender immediately!

00:16:45.060 --> 00:16:46.100
Or else...

00:16:46.100 --> 00:16:47.060
I will burn it.

00:16:47.060 --> 00:16:48.570
Look.

00:16:48.570 --> 00:16:50.480
It's gonna burn.

00:16:50.480 --> 00:16:52.190
Stop! Stop it!

00:16:52.190 --> 00:16:53.570
Stop! Please stop it!

00:16:53.570 --> 00:16:56.530
Rather than burning it, just give it to me!

00:16:56.530 --> 00:16:57.450
Never.

00:16:57.450 --> 00:16:59.410
You call yourself human?

00:17:00.120 --> 00:17:02.250
Who knows?

00:17:03.120 --> 00:17:06.540
I beg you... I beg you... that is...

00:17:06.540 --> 00:17:07.630
That...

00:17:15.340 --> 00:17:17.840
I lose.

00:17:17.840 --> 00:17:18.720
Sempai!

00:17:19.240 --> 00:17:20.470
Oh, Harem is here

00:17:20.470 --> 00:17:21.640
Good job.

00:17:21.640 --> 00:17:23.850
Quit using that name please.

00:17:23.850 --> 00:17:27.930
Rather than that, what in the world is going on?

00:17:27.930 --> 00:17:28.520
What is...?

00:17:28.990 --> 00:17:30.360
Oh this?

00:17:30.360 --> 00:17:32.480
I thought something like this might happen so...

00:17:32.820 --> 00:17:33.860
Bringing this along was well worth it.

