00:17:43.330 --> 00:17:47.420
A real maniac would be desperate to have that.

00:17:47.420 --> 00:17:51.390
Especially if it's bishoujo figure collector Baltia.

00:17:51.390 --> 00:17:54.050
Bishoujo figure?

00:17:59.140 --> 00:18:00.050
This is...

00:18:00.320 --> 00:18:01.680
Capsule toys.

00:18:02.170 --> 00:18:04.430
Items you guys call gatchapon.

00:18:05.620 --> 00:18:06.640
Could it be...

00:18:06.640 --> 00:18:09.520
These are the smuggled goods!?

00:18:10.900 --> 00:18:12.940
But why something like this?

00:18:13.070 --> 00:18:14.960
Listen well, human.

00:18:14.960 --> 00:18:17.280
In the original god and demon worlds.

00:18:17.280 --> 00:18:18.450
There was nothing.

00:18:19.240 --> 00:18:22.740
Only gods and demons existed, that's all.

00:18:22.740 --> 00:18:25.080
We are uncheangable and immortal.

00:18:25.080 --> 00:18:28.740
Because we exist forever regardless of what we do.

00:18:28.740 --> 00:18:32.880
we did not need culture or technology like humans do.

00:18:33.340 --> 00:18:35.590
I've heard of that before but...

00:18:35.590 --> 00:18:37.720
Isn't it ironic?

00:18:37.720 --> 00:18:43.470
Though we have powers uncomparable to you, and are able do anything.

00:18:43.470 --> 00:18:47.600
In reality, we don't even know what to do.

00:18:48.520 --> 00:18:51.150
So, does that mean...?

00:18:51.150 --> 00:18:53.150
In short, they are jealous...

00:18:53.150 --> 00:18:56.320
...of the original culture and
technology that humans possess.

00:18:56.320 --> 00:19:02.200
Human culture was always an object of interest and is something precious to the gods and demons.

00:19:02.700 --> 00:19:06.080
Especially if it's something difficult to obtain in the human world.

00:19:06.330 --> 00:19:13.000
Didn't I say that people who want
things regardless of how much it costs, are everywhere?

00:19:13.330 --> 00:19:15.380
No way...

00:19:18.420 --> 00:19:24.530
Human, yours is an existence that releases us from eternal boredom.

00:19:24.530 --> 00:19:26.520
Even though you are weak and powerless...

00:19:26.520 --> 00:19:32.600
No, that is the reason why you have possibilities and diversities that we could never imagine.

00:19:34.000 --> 00:19:35.270
Without you guys around...

00:19:35.690 --> 00:19:39.900
...we'd be so lonely...

00:19:40.320 --> 00:19:41.950
...we couldn't stand it.

00:19:44.740 --> 00:19:47.700
You knew this, sempai?

00:19:47.700 --> 00:19:48.750
Then why...

00:19:49.460 --> 00:19:54.840
That's because I have the same feelings that she does.

00:19:56.040 --> 00:19:57.380
Take it.

00:19:57.380 --> 00:20:01.300
And never do such a silly thing ever.

00:20:01.570 --> 00:20:03.930
Master...

00:20:06.450 --> 00:20:08.470
Thank you so much!

00:20:08.470 --> 00:20:10.850
Is this supposed to be a heartwarming scene?

00:20:11.390 --> 00:20:13.680
It was so fun.

00:20:13.680 --> 00:20:16.230
Now then, clean up time.

00:20:23.320 --> 00:20:24.360
Takuto-kun.

00:20:24.360 --> 00:20:25.960
What is all this?

00:20:26.240 --> 00:20:27.870
I'm sorry, Futaba-chan.

00:20:33.690 --> 00:20:38.750
All right! We split up and erase the memory of all the people in and around Akihabara.

00:20:38.750 --> 00:20:41.380
Eine, Dwarf, get the recovery team out!

00:20:41.680 --> 00:20:44.550
They use dwarfs cruelly these days...

00:20:44.550 --> 00:20:46.510
There, just as it was.

00:20:49.100 --> 00:20:56.810
So now we'll begin with our "Let's get more
acquainted with Tana-chan and Suzu-chan" party.

00:20:56.810 --> 00:21:00.690
I would like to say that, but...

00:21:00.980 --> 00:21:03.610
Sorry for the wait.

00:21:04.240 --> 00:21:08.450
Everyone eat up!

00:21:08.450 --> 00:21:09.990
Who the heck is she?

00:21:09.990 --> 00:21:13.290
Takuto-kun, you couldn't keep yourself entertained with just Tana-chan and Suzu-chan, so now...

00:21:13.290 --> 00:21:15.100
Uhh, that is...

00:21:15.100 --> 00:21:18.730
Oh, Falche is a dutch wife sent in a cardboard box.

00:21:18.730 --> 00:21:19.750
That expression is not helping
clear this misunderstanding....
Oh, Falche is a dutch wife sent in a cardboard box.

00:21:19.750 --> 00:21:20.710
That expression is not helping
clear this misunderstanding....

00:21:21.420 --> 00:21:22.510
A dutch...

00:21:22.510 --> 00:21:26.050
Sis, don't go near him. He seems normal but deep inside he's the erotic demon king!

00:21:26.280 --> 00:21:30.180
Oh no, I am the one who was called the demon king.

00:21:30.180 --> 00:21:31.970
Right, master?

00:21:35.040 --> 00:21:37.600
Uwwah! Futaba-chan, are you ok?

00:21:39.810 --> 00:21:41.150
There you are, Harem.

00:21:41.150 --> 00:21:46.090
This time a large-scale nekomimi-doujinshi smuggling has occurred in the god world.

00:21:46.570 --> 00:21:48.570
Let's go guys. Time to go!

